  "description": "ClickHouse tracking for test diagrams via DbConnection wrapping. Works with ClickHouse.Driver, ClickHouse.Client and Octonica.ClickHouseClient (any ADO.NET ClickHouse provider); ClickHouse.Driver's IClickHouseClient is tracked through Kronikol.Extensions.ClickHouse.Driver. Intercepts and classifies SQL operations — including ClickHouse mutations (ALTER TABLE ... UPDATE/DELETE), OPTIMIZE, RENAME, ATTACH/DETACH — with configurable verbosity. No hard dependency on a specific client package.",
